 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows September to October came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids. In 2025 that pair ran 60% of normal on the middle, and August to September ran 63%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 252% of normal on the middle. Grid 28075 had its driest year in 1971 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
